# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*.auto.tfvars
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
# Secrets / local
.env
*.pem
kubeconfig*
